<title>HONG KONG: KPI interim net profit rises 12.1 pct.</title>
<headline>KPI interim net profit rises 12.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   8.1	vs  7.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.5	vs  2.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    23.87    vs  21.30</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,750.40 vs  2,613.09</p>
<p>    Company name		 KPI Company Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 6-10, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 23, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - KPI is mainly involved in trading chemical fertiliser and agricultural products with China.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
